what My own last lap booked this twice: a guard whose population includes its own control has a failure mode no care in the guard prevents, because the control's correctness REQUIRES it to hold what the guard refuses -- awk_lcg_exact reddened on five generators existing only to be refused inside a pen, and the founding fix moved the plant rather than the meter. Nobody has asked how large that class is. Census it empirically: extract each scan's own git ls-files enumeration, run it, and ask whether any tracked file of that scan's own family stands inside the population it reads -- reporting the GATED subset apart from the ratcheted one, since a gate at zero cannot hold a control that must carry the refused shape while a ceiling absorbs it silently and reads inflated. Name the naming-convention dependency out loud, since the water row's own cardinal seat teaches that a measurement finding evidence by name reports the convention it was handed.
